09","name":"あるるかん(drops tone)","detail":"デモ曲「Agnus Dei」、OP曲「theme of Laughter Land」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:138109","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"Antistar","creatorId":"vndb:s1028","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:3957","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1028","name":"Antistar","detail":"ED曲「Wish-What?」","roleCode":"vocalist","roleLabel":"歌手","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:138110","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"パリオ","creatorId":"vndb:s2790","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:12719","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2790","name":"パリオ","detail":"OP/EDムービー","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:67476","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"由良","creatorId":"vndb:s736","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s736","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s736","name":"由良","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:19642","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"antistar","creatorId":"vndb:s1028","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1028","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1028","name":"溝端 修一","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:19644","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"唯月一","creatorId":"vndb:s8935","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8935","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8935","name":"唯月一","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:19646","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17377","characterName":"ディック","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17377"},"originalCharacterName":"ディック","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"614"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though his heart is in the right place, Richard’s innate sense of curiosity and adventure leads him to decisions he later regrets. While he has his moments of skepticism and at least tries to think before acting, he often agrees to commitments before seriously considering the consequences. He is rather mild-tempered and agreeable, though he becomes easily frustrated with the strange laws of his new home, eager to know more."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Eroderekko's blog"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His gem is located on his collarbone."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His gem has the ability to copy other gemstones' powers."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is later revealed to be a grand-nephew of Guillered."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17377"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca85fcbc5408219ad35dc651f4a62badb34685bca632cd7d0c585393ad117edb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7aa320644d2b46eed712af0cf6a1e0823f20999988554b55c3e99aef3e9dcd38.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"空野 太陽","creatorId":"vndb:s88","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s88","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s88","name":"岸尾 だいすけ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:9723","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17378","characterName":"ギュレッド","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17378"},"originalCharacterName":"ギュレッド","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Capable of traveling between worlds, Guillered is the one who created Laughter Land and is responsible for bringing all the boys there. Although his exact intentions are left to speculation, he attests that his purpose is only for the happiness of everyone. At least, his sweet, playful demeanor does seem entirely genuine, and his kindness is far from suspicious."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Eroderekko's blog"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His gem is located on his left hand."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is the older brother of Dag and Meg, Dick's grandmother. He started Laughter Land after he and his siblings were ostracised after being rescued from their mother's cult."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17378"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6c849a4dff11a54277f3641461f82396c2337afce4472f24008f5057e4197df.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7dac316f4abb0a7be069cdfbfc6f01a2571aff7a02a74e5d7771896f6989a132.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"下和田 裕貴","creatorId":"vndb:s673","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s673","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s673","name":"下和田 ヒロキ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:9728","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17379","characterName":"ロディ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17379"},"originalCharacterName":"ロディ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"510"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"His infectious optimism and adventurous urges make Roddy an invaluable friend, as he is always willing to help others in need. Each day means something new and exciting on the horizon for him, and he constantly looks for a companion to accompany him on his journey. He loves adventures and flying in the sky. He plays pranks on people a lot."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Eroderekko's blog"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c17379"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9ce151e4f6d5e9f3513b6b130496e6b590ee38e1dd774e9cdc9c9d546e6b264f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afa47ecd703d0fb935262c3b9d8931ff2c0624d821bea8064b408e0a0a192ed5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"皇 帝","creatorId":"vndb:s55","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s55","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s55","name":"皇帝","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:9720","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c17380","characterName":"ヨアン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c17380"},"originalCharacterName":"ヨアン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"319"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"In spite of his youthful appearance, Ioan is remarkably intelligent, working as an apprentice librarian of the great wizard Northbrook, and often found fervently studying in the company of his familiars. He is very shy and easily flustered, with a gentle and peaceful nature: even something as small as injured mice or withered plants deeply upsets him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Eroderekko's blog"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His gem is located on the nape of his neck."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is later revealed to be the 